366
00:14:30,260 --> 00:14:31,260
Eh...

367
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:32,260
De acuerdo.

368
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:33,260
Vamos, vamos.

369
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:34,260
Let ' s go.

370
00:15:18,260 --> 00:15:21,720
La madre del Tano.

371
